I follow search wherever it goes.

---

Started with AdSense publishers, back when one good page was a business. Watched paid units take the fold and Google keep the click. AI reset the surface...being the source the answer is built from matters again.

Ten years following that shift:

| year | surface | what mattered |
|------|---------|---------------|
| 2015 | publishers | adsense, long-tail, multivariate testing |
| 2018 | local | map pack, multi-location visibility |
| 2023 | ecommerce | catalog SEO, revenue attribution |
| 2026 | ai search | being the source, not the result |

