## What I actually do

Sole owner of organic search for a 17K-page ecommerce catalog. No paid, no social...SEO end to end.

- **Technical** ... crawl audits, indexation fixes, redirect mapping, site architecture, internal linking. Cut indexed pages 17K → 15K while holding organic impressions flat.
- **Structured data** ... schema.org deployed across a full product catalog for rich results, Shopping, and AI answer eligibility.
- **AI search** ... prompt tracking, AI Overview presence monitoring, LLM citation share of voice. Built the measurement layer from scratch because nothing off-the-shelf did it.
- **Build** ... I ship the front-end changes myself instead of filing a ticket and waiting.

